cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated article."
title: "Pabna urban tree canopy, biomass and carbon: UAV-to-PlanetScope workflow"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
abstract: >-
  Code for mapping urban tree canopy, above-ground biomass and carbon in Pabna Municipality,
  Bangladesh. SegFormer canopy segmentation of UAV imagery provides the reference for 3 m
  PlanetScope models; canopy height comes from the UAV surface and terrain models; every model is
  evaluated by leave-one-field-out (independent field) testing.
authors:
