    affiliation: "Pabna University of Science and Technology, Pabna-6600, Bangladesh"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - urban tree canopy
  - semantic segmentation
  - UAV remote sensing
  - sub-pixel mapping
  - above-ground biomass
  - spatial cross-validation
references:
